        <tr><td><strong>标准 LoRA</strong> (FP16)</td><td>2944 MB</td><td>70.4 MB</td><td>211.3 MB (12B)</td><td>350 MB (重算)</td><td><strong>4.22 GB</strong></td><td>✅ 极度流畅 (占 26%)</td><td>✅ 极度富余 (可扩大 batch)</td></tr>
